// Syncthing ignore rules for the Monitoring Project Obsidian vault.
// This file is LOCAL to each device and is deliberately not synced.
//
// WHY /.git IS EXCLUDED (do not remove):
// Syncthing replicating a live .git directory while git commits run on more
// than one machine corrupts the index and can propagate phantom deletions.
// Git backup for this vault runs on e10ubuntu ONLY, via vault-git-backup.timer.

/.git
/.obsidian/workspace*.json
/.stversions
/.trash
